---
description:
  Hexagon subgraphs (issue 2752) under dagre. Mirrors 2752-hexagon-subgraph-elk.mmd so
  the two differ only by layout engine. Dagre reserves no room for the points, so each
  frame fits its point depth to the space around its children and title.
config:
  layout: dagre
---
flowchart TD
  client[Client] --> api
  subgraph core["Application core"]@{ shape: hex }
    api[Order API] --> place[Place order]
    place --> quote[Price order]
    subgraph domain["Domain"]@{ shape: hex }
      order[Order] --> events[Order events]
    end
    place --> order
  end
  place --> db[(Database)]
